      "content": "thanks. okay so here is what i've noticed over the last two weeks: \n\nmonday the 12th - 2am to 5am (digging near my driveway)\nwednesday the 14th - 3am to 4:30am (near the curb)\nfriday the 16th - 2am to 5am (down the street)\n\nit's always in the middle of the night when nobody is awake to see what they're actually doing. plus they aren't even replacing parts, they just seem to be placing small devices and then leaving. does the timing of this seem weird to you?",
